CHANGE: Added 76 lines of base gallery styles before the existing horizontal-scroll variant.
REASON: BrandGallery component was using grid layout class names (.brand-gallery, .gallery-item,
        .gallery-img, .gallery-overlay, .gallery-overlay-text) that had no CSS definitions.
VERDICT: Feature addition — needed for gallery to render correctly. Safe to commit.

New classes added:
  .brand-gallery-container  — width: 100% wrapper
  .brand-gallery            — CSS Grid, auto-fill minmax(200px,1fr), gap 1rem
  .gallery-item             — rounded, overflow-hidden, aspect-ratio 4/3, hover lift effect
  .gallery-img              — cover fit, hover scale(1.05)
  .gallery-overlay          — gradient overlay, fades in on hover
  .gallery-overlay-text     — white bold text, text-shadow

