FILE: dax-main/src/components/FloatingBubbles.jsx
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
CHANGE: Moved bubble array generation from inside the component function to module-level constants.
REASON: Arrays generated inside the component created new random values on every re-render,
        causing Framer Motion to restart animations on every parent re-render.
        Module-level constants are computed once at import time and stable forever.
VERDICT: Performance fix. No visual change. Safe to commit.

  OLD: bubbles and largeBubbles generated inside FloatingBubbles()
  NEW: BUBBLES and LARGE_BUBBLES as module-level const arrays

